(* README *)

1 - Overview
    --------

    S001 is a general logic formulary.

    The package begins as a tutorial-style sequence of small Rocq proofs,
    starting with elementary propositional logic. Later files can extend this
    into negation, disjunction, quantifiers, equivalence, classical principles,
    proof patterns, and reusable logical lemmas.


2 - Files
    -----

    S001_00_Premises

      Entry point and first tutorial layer. Introduces basic propositional
      proof terms and scripts for identity, conjunction, and implication
      composition.

    S001_01__Syllogism

      Propositional proof patterns for implication, conjunction, disjunction,
      negation, contradiction, contraposition, biconditionals, and simple
      syllogistic composition.

    S001_02__Quantifiers

      Predicate-logic layer. Introduces universal and existential
      quantification, specialization, witnesses, existential destruction,
      predicates over natural numbers, and the first equality lemmas leading
      toward rewriting.
